<title>USA: Waverly Iowa, won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Waverly Iowa, won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust said it won $2.450 million of Waverly, Iowa, general obligation bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.394 percent.</p>
</text>
